WEBVTT

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.960
I have my first class today.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.750
We'll teach each other
stuff we don't know.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.130
There's so much I still don't know
about Shadows House. I can hardly wait!

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.510
However...

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.970
Oh!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.060
Mia.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.350
U-Um...

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.650
Emilico! Good morning!

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:42.940
Huh?

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.440
What's wrong?

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.360
Still half-asleep?

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.660
I thought you didn't like me.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.540
You mean the last time we met?
Those were Sarah's emotions.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.620
You have a lot to learn.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.790
Oh...

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.790
Did I miss something?

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.960
It's our little secret, isn't it?

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.970
Everyone is here.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.590
Let the class begin.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:16.810
But let us dispense with the formalities.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:20.350
We shall give Emilico
a tour of the house today.

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.770
Okay!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:56.570
The Soot Sickness

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.160
First, the hall of cleaning implements.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.580
One might call this
a gathering spot for living dolls.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.200
After we cleaned the great hall,
I put my broom away here!

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.960
Mine is...

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.920
this one!

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.380
That's right.

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:11.880
Next time, you can come get it yourself.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.920
Are these for cleaning, too?

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:18.550
We use them in emergencies.
But that doesn't happen too often.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.220
Hmm?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.730
Where do those stairs go?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.900
To the kitchen and laundry.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.270
Lou, do you know who works there?

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:34.190
The veiled dolls.
There's no need for us to go there.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.490
That's right. Well done.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:41.700
Emilico, you need not give any
thought to such places, either.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.870
This is the classroom!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.250
Will I learn my letters here?

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:50.420
Let's do that next time.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.460
This is Shadows House's...

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.970
That's right. This house
has different floors.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:04.350
The living dolls' rooms are below
the Shadows family's living quarters.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.810
What's this?

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:10.560
That is a portrait. You wear
it when serving as a face.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:14.400
The arms and legs are covered
in lace so your face will stand out.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.650
It's a living doll's formal attire.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.280
You will wear it after the debut.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.860
The debut?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.030
It's yet to come for you and Lou.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.200
Lou hasn't done it yet, either?

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.790
This is the great hall,
which we cleaned last time.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.380
Huh?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.460
Hmm?

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.720
The soot is already collecting.
Shall we clean it up?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.140
Oh my!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.560
Your sharp eye is impressive!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.310
I think I'm going to like you!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.230
But you need not fret
over such a small amount.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:58.490
Ordinarily, we would clean it up,
but our lesson takes precedence today!

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:00.150
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:10.160
Lou, can you tell us
where that hallway leads?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.670
The debut hall.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.330
Yes, that is correct. Very good!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.800
Um, what do we do during the debut?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.920
It is a very important ceremony.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.840
The competency of both
shadow and doll will be judged.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.050
And whether they will be
an asset to the Shadows family.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.930
Once a Shadows family member debuts,
they are said to have a face.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.940
That is a sign of adulthood.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:36.070
Oh, so then Mistress Kate
is not yet an adult?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:39.440
Right. You might say
she is in her trial period.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.450
Do debuts ever not go so well?

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:51.750
Forgive me, but we're not supposed
to discuss any details about the debut.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.880
All we can say is do the best you can.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.050
Are there any dolls
older than you, Rosemary?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.010
Why, of course there are.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.550
They're in another wing of the house.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.890
It's where the lords live.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:13.230
You mustn't fret over trivial matters.

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:18.190
Living dolls must feel nothing but
loyalty toward the Shadows family.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.360
You must remember that.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.490
How go your sentiments
toward the Shadows family,

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.820
so they go toward each shadow master.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.910
Abide by this, and we shall be happy.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.660
But living dolls that
are not loyal and useful

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.910
will be discarded.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.370
Discarded?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:39.040
Come to think of it, Lord Grandfather--

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.090
Only the members of the
Shadows family call him that.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:48.600
We call him the Lord of Shadows
House and the Shadows Family,

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.220
Father of All Living Dolls,

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.230
The Grand Creator.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.900
But those words must
seldom pass your lips.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:01.730
Such an eminent name will be tainted
if those of our standing speak it.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:06.240
Did I say more than I should have?

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:10.830
It's the emergency bell. That means...

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.040
A phantom.

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.370
A phantom?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.330
To the hall of cleaning implements!

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.760
Mia, how do I put this on?

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.640
Your soot suit is fine for now. Hurry!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:35.100
This is for places that
are thick with soot.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.730
But it obscures your vision.
We must use our tools properly.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:44.190
A phantom? As in that thing
we heard of? They really do exist?

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.240
This is my first time, too.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.570
What thing?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.660
A cluster of scorches.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.200
What's a scorch?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:56.750
A scorch is soot that gathers together
and begins to move with ill intent.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.580
Soot... that moves?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.590
What is that?!

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.300
What now?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.890
Let's wait for the
Star Bearer's instructions.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:17.890
Get to work, you sluggards!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.190
It's the doll I saw the other day.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.190
This problem won't fix itself!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.570
Barbie! We brought the hammers. What now?

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:26.740
Smash it to bits, you maggots!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.830
Are you all right?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.330
Rose, you dimwit!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.000
Is your whole team
made up of dimwits, too?!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:47.590
The rest of you worthless fools,
smash those scorches!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.590
Emilico, let's get 'em!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.390
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.900
That Star Bearer truly
is a horrible creature.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.110
Star Bearers are very important dolls,

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:08.110
and scorches are soot that
gathered and started to move.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:13.280
And if even more gather,
they form a phantom.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:17.750
Save it for later. This isn't a classroom!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.290
Where did it hide?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.340
I think it's behind this painting.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:29.880
I want you to poke it from that side.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.720
I'll smack it when it comes out.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:32.630
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.970
You two sure are quick.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.060
Look out!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.690
Rosemary!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.650
Smack it! Smack it!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.870
No, Lou! Not Rose!
Smack the soot on her head!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.120
She collapsed!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.460
We must remove it quickly!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.380
There's one over here, too!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.280
Oh, no!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.620
She'll hang to death!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.370
Stop kicking, Rose!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.210
Please! Not my face!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.040
Water.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.750
Huh?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.800
Pouring water on scorches
makes them slow and brittle.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.050
I read it in the manual.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.510
Cleaning spray.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:03.350
It worked! Try some more!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.610
Lou! It won't reach!

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:12.110
This is all I have in my cleaning kit.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.070
I'll go fill up a bucket!

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:16.820
It's too far. You won't make it in time.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:17.870
Enough of this!

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.240
I'm going to let go
before she scars my face!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.330
I don't like making choices.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:27.710
Emilico, which one would
you save, Mia or Rosemary?

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.840
Emilico!

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.270
Ow, ow, ow.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:56.150
What a relief. The scorch came off.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:12:00.910
We're supposed to clean up,
yet you made a mess with that water.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.580
F-Forgive me!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.700
That never occurred to me.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.500
You're amazing, Emilico.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:15.010
Mistress Kate is always scolding me
for tipping over vases full of water.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:18.130
You never think outside the box, Lou.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.640
Rosemary?

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:40.950
Rosemary?

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.620
It's the soot sickness.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.490
The first-aid team will handle it.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:51.130
We must have her drink
a large quantity of water.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:53.340
Let's take her to the washroom.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.380
Put her to sleep.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:01.340
We better clean up all this soot.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.180
You're right.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:07.520
Rosemary.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:12.810
We never finished today's lesson,
but I learned something important.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.650
We must always be diligent in our cleaning

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.200
so that soot can't collect
and start moving.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.630
Good morning, Rolly.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.680
Y-You moved!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:48.680
Rolly, I'm right here. Come to me!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.390
Huh?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.940
That's strange.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:55.610
I just saw you move.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.780
What's wrong, Emilico?
Didn't get enough sleep?

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:03.410
Yes, ma'am. I didn't
sleep well last night.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:07.120
I'm not surprised, considering
that scare on your first day of class.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.290
It shocked even me.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.830
Is Rosemary going to be all right?

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.790
She'll be fine. She was
still moving, after all.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.050
And it's Rose we're talking about.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.670
She'll say something like,
"That was so embarrassing,"

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.340
and be back before you know it.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:29.350
But enough about that.
Today, we have something fun in store!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:32.730
We will wash ourselves
squeaky clean in the washroom.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.350
Each bath is made for two.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.480
Emilico, you can go in with me.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.030
Lou, you go find someone else.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.110
But first...

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.650
Huh?

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.660
I'll never get used to that.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:53.460
It makes me dizzy.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.420
This feels so good!

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.670
Is this the same stuff used for cleaning?

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:00.960
It's a special type of soap for dolls.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.800
I was scared.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:07.010
I thought water would
get inside me, and I'd break.

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:11.140
Don't worry. Living dolls
are finely crafted.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:16.100
Does "finely crafted"
mean we're built to last?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.520
Something like that.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.440
Come to think of it, you don't
know many words, do you?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.240
That's right. I'm still
learning my letters.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.280
I was able to read when I was born.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.780
You could?

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:32.950
It seems the starting
line differs for each doll.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.790
I was born brilliant.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:39.380
Mistress Sarah was quite delighted
when I came to serve as her face.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:40.460
And you?

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.300
Mistress Kate is always scolding me.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:48.970
Well, consider yourself lucky.
I will teach you all sorts of things.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.760
Hurray! I can hardly wait!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.770
What do we do here?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.990
You didn't warn me.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.700
It was just a little prank.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.620
Forgive me!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.460
All right, we're even now! Stop!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:26.590
Did you enjoy your cleaning?

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:32.300
Even better things await as your
shadow master's standing rises.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.390
There's Lou!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.350
Rosemary!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.310
Are you all better now?

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.310
Yes, but I had quite a fright.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:46.400
I had heard of the soot sickness,
but to think I would contract it.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.110
What is the soot sickness?

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.160
It occurs when scorches enter the body.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.870
If left untreated,
the afflicted doll will break.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.250
It is quite dreadful.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.790
But with swift treatment,
one need not worry.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.870
We have an excellent first-aid team.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.960
You must drink plenty of water.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.050
Indeed. You must flush out all the soot.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.800
It is so much water,
you never want to drink again.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:12.010
So you're all better now! I'm so glad!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.720
This just won't do.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:17.470
I wished to show what
a fine team leader I could be.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.810
That was so embarrassing.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.490
Did I say something funny?

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:33.240
And then Rosemary came back,
and she was completely fine.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.280
The first-aid team is the best!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.660
I'm so glad the four of us will
be able to clean together again.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.420
Oh, that's wonderful.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.830
Is something wrong?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.210
Kate has never heard of a phantom.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:50.050
Oh, forgive me. I didn't mean
to keep talking like that.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:52.470
No, it's quite all right.

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:53.680
However...

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.470
As you've been told before,

00:17:55.470 --> 00:18:00.390
if you move things while cleaning,
put them back where you found them.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.100
Forgive me! I hadn't noticed!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.020
What was it I moved?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.490
That stuffed toy wasn't where it belongs.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:11.280
Yours, too, Mistress Kate?!

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:14.780
My Rolly moved on his own, too!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:19.790
You may correct your failings,
but excuses will not be tolerated.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.250
B-But I saw it happen!

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:27.500
Living dolls can move,
so stuffed toys should be--

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.090
They're not the same thing!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.550
It flew.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.850
I knew it! Stuffed toys <i>can </i>move!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:44.810
It is the power of our Lord Grandfather
that breathes life into living dolls.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.650
Dolls and toys couldn't
possibly move on their own.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:52.030
Then perhaps you, too,
have great power, Mistress Kate.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:55.990
Why don't you try and make Rolly move?

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.160
Is such a thing possible?

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.210
It truly was Kate.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:08.500
I knew it!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.460
To think such a thing was possible...

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.970
But nothing else moves
besides stuffed toys.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.930
Why stuffed toys?

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.930
Rolly and Kate's stuffed toy...

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.850
I sewed them up.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.020
Oh, I know! It's the soot!

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.860
Mistress Kate, you can make soot move!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.770
But it was the stuffed toys that moved.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:35.320
Actually, I stuffed Rolly with
the soot from your sootman.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.410
What? Why would you do that?

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.700
I didn't have any spare cotton.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.030
Plus...

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:44.960
I wanted to put something
I treasure into something I cherish.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:49.500
Now I'll always feel like you are nearby.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.840
To think you'd use a sootman
Kate made in that manner...

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.590
You're weird.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.680
D-Did I do something wrong?!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.600
Never mind. Just clean up.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.470
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.180
Soot is emitted due to negative feelings.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.770
That's why scorches
begin moving with ill intent.

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:13.320
But soot can also be made to move
on purpose like Mistress Kate did.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:16.450
Why can Mistress Kate make soot move?

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:20.740
And that phantom we saw...
Was someone making it move?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:24.500
And the lords in the
other wing of the house...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:29.670
Living dolls must feel nothing but
loyalty toward the Shadows family!

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.630
I mustn't fret over trivial matters!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.010
You rang, Mistress Kate?

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:44.260
Wow! I can't believe you can
already control it like that!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.680
But only for a short time.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.230
It's still amazing!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:52.940
I can't wait to tell the other
living dolls what you can do!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.570
That is why Kate summoned you.

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:58.400
Tell no one about this, at least not yet.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.490
Shadow lore says
nothing about such things.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:03.280
We must be careful.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.290
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.500
The debut draws near,
and there is so much to learn.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.830
But shadows mustn't
leave their room before then.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.210
We must study using what books we have.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:19.010
Living dolls are allowed
to gather, but not shadows?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:23.800
That's right. But we could learn more from
one another by exchanging information.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:24.970
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.970
We shall have to study together.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.430
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.650
Mistress Kate!

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:35.110
You're quite weary.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:38.070
We'll begin our studies tomorrow.

00:21:38.070 --> 00:21:40.360
Forgive me.

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:14.330
How many candidates remain?

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:17.670
We must cull the failed fruit with haste.

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:19.920
Let us hope it's as fun as last time.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:23.090
Edward, how goes the debut preparations?

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:25.430
All shall be ready soon.

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:27.850
Please leave it to me.

00:23:27.850 --> 00:23:32.180
The debut... It's my big chance now
that I've been chosen as judge.

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:35.890
I will give the third-floor lords
a show they won't forget.

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:41.230
Perhaps I'll even rise to the third floor
if Lord Grandfather notices me.

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:43.820
The candidates are of no consequence.

00:23:43.820 --> 00:23:47.530
What matters is that
this goes as I planned.

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.990
Next episode

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.990
Watchers in the Night

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.400
Next episode, "Watchers in the Night."
